        "_note": "Doors are matched by location. routing-scraper's ILC map has two portals on floor 1, ilc-portal-south (4.6 m from ilc-sw) and ilc-portal-west (7.6 m from ilc-se), taken from ArcGIS entrance points that carry no floor. The on-site check found those two doors open onto floor 2, so ilc-sw and ilc-se replace them. The ILC's real floor-1 doors are the two vestibules on the north wing's glass wall (ilc-north-floor1, ilc-west-floor1); ground there is ~65 m, vs 69.5-71.5 m at the floor-2 doors (USGS 3DEP). Neither floor-1 door is in the scraper map or the frontend's building data.",
